// F7: torus() as a zone selects no edge („0 edges“) although the upper circular edge lies exactly on
// the core line of the torus (also with tube radius 2). A flat ring (difference of two
// cylinders) as a zone selects it. Workaround: module ringzone() in the flange.
// Status (report 13): fixed – cause: tolerance 0 of the moved torus (see F8).
// SOLL: keine Warnungen
fillet(1) {
    cylinder(h = 10, r = 20);
    translate([0, 0, 10]) torus(20, 1);
}
